      "side": 1,
      "message": "Beware of threading here. One difference between Executor and Handler is that executors are allowed to execute their runnables inline, which will block the calling thread. Given that you\u0027ve created a Handler thread here, this might be OK.\n\nA great doc on Executors and how to use them in Android code is:\n\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1VItf9hyqG6Zh0u3LVUNbfTUT1ErTzo0xYioUuTaOJj4/edit#",
